go playground — browser-based Go IDE, zero server.

built with [next.js](https://nextjs.org/), [monaco editor](https://microsoft.github.io/monaco-editor/), and [yaegi](https://github.com/traefik/yaegi) (go interpreter compiled to wasm).

everything runs client-side. no api calls, no serverless functions.

```
npm install
npm run dev     → localhost:3000
npx vercel      → deploy
```

[repo](https://github.com/ufraaan/go-playground)